---
title: "wonplug — Dual Cutter Manual Coffee Grinder"
description: "A budget hand grinder with a nitrogen-hardened steel conical burr and adjustable coarseness."
date: "2026-10-27"
tags: ["grinder", "hand grinder"]
brand: "wonplug"
category: "Hand grinder"
---

If you're still using a blade grinder or buying pre-ground coffee, this is an inexpensive way to try a burr grinder. The conical burr gives a much more even grind than a blade, and you can adjust the coarseness for different brew methods.

It won't match the higher-end grinders on this list, but it's a big step up from pre-ground. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
